		(property "Note" "SENS_V1 pull-down, fitted (generic voltage port, 13.5.11). Two jobs: (1) open-wire detection - with the sensor unplugged U8's 1 Mohm input would float to an internal bias voltage that reads as data (SBAS680 8.3.1); 47k pulls it to ~4% of that bias, near 0 V, below any sensor's valid window. (2) A defined load inside every automotive driver's rating (Bosch TMAP: >= 10 kohm). 0.1 mA at 5 V. Closes open item 20."
			(at 36.83 144.78 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
