		(property "Note" "SENS_R1 pull-up to 5V_SENS (ratiometric with CH3), the resistive port's default (13.5.11). 4.99k suits automotive NTCs (~2-5 kohm at 20 C, Bosch TMAP 2.5k): <= 1.0 mA sensor current, mid-range at 20 C. A low-ohm sender (fuel level, 30-240 ohm) needs ~100-200 ohm here instead. Software must know the fitted value: it is part of the resistance solve."
			(at 54.61 171.45 0)
			(hide yes)
